{"version":1,"content":"<p>《俠盜獵車手VI》（GTA VI）無疑是當前規模最大的遊戲之一，全球數百萬玩家正在虛構的雷奧尼達州探索，並跟隨主角露西亞和傑森完成任務。主機玩家正在享受系列最新作，PC玩家同樣迫切希望體驗這款遊戲，這促使社區中出現了大量自製移植嘗試。網絡犯罪分子已經注意到這一現象，並利用相關項目發動詐騙，藉機傳播ClickFix等惡意軟件。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1588226.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T12:43:56.958014+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T12:18:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T12:37:17.639573+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:37:17.639573+00:00","content_hash":"3e1b0c88781d4a0959214bc6c45e325aa757fbf730901cc51734f21810474c5e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}